# The scanner service is deployed to Railway, never to Vercel.
scanner-service

# Tests and fixtures are not part of the Next.js app, and some of them import
# from scanner-service/ on purpose (the root Vitest tree runs the scanner's
# modules). Because `scanner-service` is excluded above, those imports cannot
# resolve on Vercel and the production type check fails, even though the same
# build passes locally where the folder exists. Keeping tests out of the upload
# fixes that and keeps test code out of the production bundle.
tests
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
